  of eternity  she tells Lincoln he is adopted and has  special non-human powers which she shows  him how to use fire slashes story has a  lot of twists and turns the loud dragon  the clever author who goes by a goji  house wrote a story that crosses the  loud house with How to Train Your Dragon  it's quite an interesting tale in this  piece lisa is experimenting with a  chemical that creates a Night Fury the  chemical actually has Night Fury DNA in  it  Lincoln hears a mysterious roar coming  from Lisa's bedroom so he decides to  check it out when he enters Lisa's room  she is surrounded by a strange mist the  mist makes Lincoln transform into a  Night Fury  Lincoln teams up with his sisters to  fight a creature called a monstrous  nightmare  Lincoln gets wounded but they ultimately  team up with other dragons to defeat the  beast they ride on the backs of the  other dragons during the huge battle  flew to Lin Laurie and luan come  together to help Lincoln who is still a  Night Fury  they help heal his wounds and take care  of him the story ends with song lyrics  that read stay close to me you're right  beyond the trees open your eyes and see  this fan fiction piece has it all it's  filled with amazing dragon battles the  love between siblings funny moments and  it ends with a song it's an unexpected  crossover we didn't know we needed the  visitors from troll burg one clever fan  fiction author decided to combine two  animated kit shows to see how the  characters would interact we all know  Lincoln loud and Ronnie Ann as the  friends who bonded after a rocky start  to their friendship Ronnie used to pick  on Lincoln until his sisters intervened  and found out that Ronnie actually likes  Lincoln they became friends and have  been ever since Hilda is a show that is  currently streaming on Netflix it  follows the adventures of a courageous  girl with blue hair she travels a long  way from home which is in a vast magical  and filled with elves and Giants she  journeys